{"sourceUrl":"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/23656.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:48.502870+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/23656.html","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>  <span>依据《北京交通大学20</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>7年招收推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）研究生办法》、《北京交通大学2027年推免生招生专业目录》、《关于做好2027年招收推免生工作的通知》等学校相关要求，为保证20</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>7年推免生招收工作的有序推进，</span></span><span><span>系统科学学院</span></span><span><span>特制订本实施方案。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  一</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、学生申请</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  欢迎优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读北京交通大学系统科学学院硕士、博士研究生。我校推免生只招收全日制。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span><span>（一）招生专业</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><strong><span>代码</span></strong></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><strong><span>名称</span></strong></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><strong><span>是否接收硕士</span></strong></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><strong><span>是否接收直博推免</span></strong></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>071100</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>系统科学</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085411</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>大数据技术与工程（专业学位）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>否</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span> </span> （</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>二</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请条件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  1. </span></span></span><span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  2. </span></span></span><span><span><span><span>本科专业应为相关理学专业（系统科学与工程、数学、统计、物理等）；或交通运</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>输类专业；或管理类专业；或计算机、自动化、通信工程、人工智能、大数据等专业。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  3. 获得推荐学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>如所在学校尚未完成推免资格评定工作，但预计可取得推免生资格者，也可申请</span><span>)，最终拟录取结果以学生是否具有推免资格及复试成绩等决定。</span></span></span></span> </span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  4. 学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  5. 身心健康，符合规定的体检要求。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  （三）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>申请材料</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  1.有效居民身份证；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  2.学信网学籍在线验证报告；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  3.本科成绩单，要求加盖学生所在学校教务处公章；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  4.学术科研成果（公开发表的论文、出版的专著等）、国家英语四（六）级成绩单、获奖证书等；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  5.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>申请直接攻读博士研究生者（直博生）还须提供《直博生个人陈述表》（附件</span><span>1）、两位申请攻读学位学科领域内的教授（或相当专业技术职称）专家的《直博生专家推荐书》（附件2）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。以上申请材料由考生在我校推免预报名系统上传电子版图片，可通过对原件进行扫描或拍照生成，上传电子版为</span><span>pdf或jpg格式，每个附件大小不超过1M。申请人必须保证全部申请材料以及网上报名信息的真实性和准确性。如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，我校将取消申请人推免录取资格，并通报申请人所在学校，责任由申请人自负。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  </span><span>（四）申请流程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>  推免选拔报名系统网址</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://gsadmission.bjtu.edu.cn/recommend/signin/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://gsadmission.bjtu.edu.cn/recommend/signin/</span></span></span></a><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>考生可在</span><span>9月8日00:01至9月11日23:59期间进行预报名，按系统要求填写报名信息并上传申请材料，每个申请人只能填报一个志愿。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  二</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复试流程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>      </span><span>复试采用线下方式开展，由基本材料审核和综合能力面试两部分构成。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  基本材料审核环节，考生线上提交材料后，专家组（不少于5人）将结合考生学术研究经历、本科课程成绩、个人陈述等情况给出对应成绩，成绩满分100分，保留2位小数，该成绩占复试总成绩的30%。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  综合能力面试考核内容包括外语能力测试、专业及综合能力测试两部分。外语能力测试主要考查考生的外语听力及口语水平。专业及综合能力测试主要考查考生大学阶段学习情况及成绩；对本学科（专业）理论知识和应用技能掌握程度；利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力；对本学科发展动态的了解以及在本专业领域发展的潜力；创新精神和创新能力；思想政治素质和道德品质；本学科（专业）以外的学习、科研、社会实践（学生工作、社团活动、志愿服务等）或实际工作表现等方面的情况；事业心、责任感、纪律性（遵纪守法）、协作性；心理健康情况；人文素养；举止、表达和礼仪等。每位考生面试时间不少于20分钟，其中包括不超过8分钟的个人展示环节（中文），个人展示环节考生可自行准备PPT。面试成绩满分100分，保留2位小数，该成绩占复试总成绩的70%。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  基本材料审核不合格（60 分以下）者不予录取；综合能力面试不合格（60 分以下）者不予录取。如总成绩相同，则比较综合能力面试成绩，成绩高者优先录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>  另，复试结束后我院将通过邮件或手机短信通知等方式向获得拟录取资格的考生发送在线心理测评题目，请各位同学核对报名时系统中填报的手机号码和电子邮箱，确保可接收到测评短信信息。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>具体流程如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><strong><span>环节</span></strong></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><strong><span>时间</span></strong></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><strong><span>方式</span></strong></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>报名</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9月8日-9月11日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>请在系统中准确填写身份证号、手机号、电子信箱等个人信息，避免因个人信息填写不准确延误通知及信息获取。填报志愿时，报名方式选择“推荐免试”。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>基本材料审核</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9月14日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>线上审核材料。确定复试名单，发送复试通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>确认复试</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9月15日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>考</span></span></span><span><span><span>生</span></span></span><span><span><span>在预报名系统中确认复试，缴费复试费，缴费网址：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>https://gsadmission.bjtu.edu.cn/recommend/signin_new/</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>综合能力面试</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9月17日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>面试分组名单及地点届时会公布在学院网站。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>心理测评</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>具体安排届时学院网站通知</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  三</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、录取流程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  1.复试小组将有意向接收并考核合格的申请人及其拟录取导师报送学院招生工作领导小组审核。学院将坚持公平公正的原则，在全面考查、综合评价的基础上，根据招生计划，分批择优录取推免生。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  2. 9月21日，申请人（含已通过我校推免预报名复试的申请人）须登录教育部“推免服务系统”（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/）进行网上报名，</span></span></span><span><span><span>教育部“推免服务系统”预计9月2</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>日9：00开通，如开通时间有变化，以最终实际开通时间为准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  考生须按照如下要求完成研招网拟录取流程的各个环节。此外请各位考生在研招网设置短信提示，以便第一时间获取相关通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>环节</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>时间</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>申报志愿</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span>日9:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>参加我院复试的考生均须按照复试志愿</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（专业、类别）填报。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>复试通知</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月22日8:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>学院会在该时间内一次性对考生发放复试通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>复试确认</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月22日8:30</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>考生须在收到复试通知后在半小时内登录研招网确认复试。逾期未确认视为放弃拟录取资格，空余名额将递补录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>拟录取通知</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>9月24日8:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>学院会在该时间内分批次对已确认复试的考生发放拟录取通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>拟录取确认</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月24日14:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>拟录取一旦确认，学院和考生双方将达成拟录取协定，拟录取资格将无法取消。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  四</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、其他说明</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  1</span></span></span><span><span><span>.导师双选</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  考生可根据“研究生院-招生专题-导师在线”的导师信息提前联系导师。获得拟录取资格的考生须填写《考生报考导师意向表》（附件3），考生和第一志愿导师签字确认后（或电子签名），于10月15日前将电子版扫描件发回至xtyjs@bjtu.edu.cn，邮件标题及附件须以“推免导师申报+姓名+身份证号”命名。至10月15日尚未联系到导师的考生，请发送标题为“服从学院调剂导师+姓名+身份证号”的邮件即可，学院将协助安排导师。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  2</span></span></span><span><span><span>.政审调档</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  学院拟定于2027年5月（统考结束后）对获得拟录取资格的考生进行政审、调档等相关正式录取工作，届时会在系统科学学院网站招生信息栏公布，请各位考生注意查看。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  咨询电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>010-51683631</span></span></span><span><span><span>，邮箱xtyjs@bjtu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>系统科学学院研究生办公室</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4>附件：</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/media/attachments/2026/09/20260909230540_824.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：直博生个人陈述表.doc</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/media/attachments/2026/09/20260909230540_507.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：直博生专家推荐书.doc</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/media/attachments/2026/09/20260909230540_413.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：考生报考导师意向表.doc</a>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"7498e41a0f77d3b30386c9708aa96f19021b6e91204f13b1c9ea446f640f3d4a","textLength":2787,"sourceSha256":"7ee7352c957eb098ac517f3e51d560e70570940bfc0bd5517022ea8288195140","selector":".article-content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ae85589ce3a5d5d19a77","title":"2026年北京交通大学系统科学学院2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生（含直博生）预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:48.502870+00:00"}
